SUMMARY:SEMINAR SERIES: A tale of two metabolites - Creatine and Homoarginine in Heart Disease
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Craig Lygate (University of Glasgow)\nHost: Cecile Benezech\n\nTitle: "A tale of two metabolites: the therapeutic potential of creatine and homoarginine in heart disease"\n\nCreatine matches energy supply and demand in the heart. Homoarginine has no known biological requirement, yet low levels are associated with poor outcomes in cardiovascular disease.\n\nSocial: Pizza 13:00-13:30 - The Larder
LOCATION:Auditorium A, Shirley Hall, Chancellors Building
